{
  "uid": "omp-overview",
  "title": "OMP — Overview",
  "tags": ["omp", "overview"],
  "timezone": "utc",
  "schemaVersion": 39,
  "version": 1,
  "refresh": "30s",
  "editable": false,
  "graphTooltip": 1,
  "time": {
    "from": "now-6h",
    "to": "now"
  },
  "timepicker": {
    "refresh_intervals": ["10s", "30s", "1m", "5m", "15m", "30m", "1h"],
    "time_options": ["5m", "15m", "1h", "6h", "24h", "7d", "30d"]
  },
  "templating": {
    "list": [
      {
        "name": "env",
        "label": "Environment",
        "type": "query",
        "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
        "query": "label_values(up, env)",
        "refresh": 2,
        "includeAll": true,
        "multi": true,
        "current": { "text": "All", "value": "$__all" },
        "sort": 1,
        "hide": 0
      },
      {
        "name": "instance",
        "label": "Instance",
        "type": "query",
        "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
        "query": "label_values(up{env=~\"$env\"}, instance)",
        "refresh": 2,
        "includeAll": true,
        "multi": true,
        "current": { "text": "All", "value": "$__all" },
        "sort": 1,
        "hide": 0
      }
    ]
  },
  "annotations": {
    "list": [
      {
        "name": "Deployments",
        "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
        "enable": false,
        "iconColor": "blue",
        "expr": "changes(process_start_time_seconds{job=~\"$job\"}[5m]) > 0",
        "tagKeys": "job,instance",
        "titleFormat": "Service restart"
      }
    ]
  },
  "panels": [
    {
      "id": 1,
      "type": "row",
      "title": "Health",
      "collapsed": false,
      "gridPos": { "h": 1, "w": 24, "x": 0, "y": 0 }
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Scrape Targets Up",
      "description": "Number of Prometheus scrape targets currently responding. Should equal the total number of configured targets when everything is healthy.",
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
      "gridPos": { "h": 4, "w": 6, "x": 0, "y": 1 },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "sum(up{env=~\"$env\", instance=~\"$instance\"})",
          "instant": true,
          "legendFormat": "up"
        },
        {
          "refId": "B",
          "expr": "count(up{env=~\"$env\", instance=~\"$instance\"})",
          "instant": true,
          "legendFormat": "total"
        }
      ],
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": { "calcs": ["lastNotNull"], "fields": "", "values": false },
        "orientation": "auto",
        "textMode": "value_and_name",
        "colorMode": "value",
        "graphMode": "area",
        "justifyMode": "auto"
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short",
          "decimals": 0,
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              { "color": "red", "value": null },
              { "color": "yellow", "value": 1 },
              { "color": "green", "value": 4 }
            ]
          }
        },
        "overrides": [
          {
            "matcher": { "id": "byName", "options": "total" },
            "properties": [
              { "id": "color", "value": { "mode": "fixed", "fixedColor": "blue" } }
            ]
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Targets by Tier",
      "description": "Breakdown of scrape targets by tier label (ingress, observability, auth, app). Useful for spotting a whole class of targets being down.",
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
      "gridPos": { "h": 4, "w": 6, "x": 6, "y": 1 },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "count by (tier) (up{env=~\"$env\", instance=~\"$instance\"} == 1)",
          "instant": true,
          "legendFormat": "{{tier}}"
        }
      ],
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": { "calcs": ["lastNotNull"], "fields": "", "values": false },
        "orientation": "horizontal",
        "textMode": "value_and_name",
        "colorMode": "value",
        "graphMode": "none",
        "justifyMode": "auto"
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short",
          "decimals": 0,
          "color": { "mode": "palette-classic" }
        },
        "overrides": []
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "5xx Error Rate (5m)",
      "description": "Percentage of requests through Traefik that returned a 5xx status code over the last 5 minutes. Above 5% is concerning; above 20% is an outage.",
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
      "gridPos": { "h": 4, "w": 6, "x": 12, "y": 1 },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "100 * sum(rate(traefik_entrypoint_requests_total{env=~\"$env\", code=~\"5..\"}[5m])) / clamp_min(sum(rate(traefik_entrypoint_requests_total{env=~\"$env\"}[5m])), 0.001)",
          "instant": true,
          "legendFormat": "5xx %"
        }
      ],
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": { "calcs": ["lastNotNull"], "fields": "", "values": false },
        "orientation": "auto",
        "textMode": "value",
        "colorMode": "background",
        "graphMode": "area",
        "justifyMode": "auto"
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "percent",
          "decimals": 2,
          "min": 0,
          "max": 100,
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              { "color": "green", "value": null },
              { "color": "yellow", "value": 5 },
              { "color": "red", "value": 20 }
            ]
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Requests / Second (5m)",
      "description": "Total request rate through Traefik, averaged over 5 minutes, across all entrypoints.",
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
      "gridPos": { "h": 4, "w": 6, "x": 18, "y": 1 },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "sum(rate(traefik_entrypoint_requests_total{env=~\"$env\"}[5m]))",
          "instant": true,
          "legendFormat": "req/s"
        }
      ],
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": { "calcs": ["lastNotNull"], "fields": "", "values": false },
        "orientation": "auto",
        "textMode": "value",
        "colorMode": "value",
        "graphMode": "area",
        "justifyMode": "auto"
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "reqps",
          "decimals": 2,
          "color": { "mode": "fixed", "fixedColor": "blue" }
        },
        "overrides": []
      }
    },

    {
      "id": 10,
      "type": "row",
      "title": "Traffic",
      "collapsed": false,
      "gridPos": { "h": 1, "w": 24, "x": 0, "y": 5 }
    },
    {
      "id": 11,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Request Rate by Entrypoint",
      "description": "Requests per second through Traefik, split by entrypoint (web = HTTP, websecure = HTTPS, metrics = internal Prometheus scraping).",
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
      "gridPos": { "h": 8, "w": 12, "x": 0, "y": 6 },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "sum by (entrypoint) (rate(traefik_entrypoint_requests_total{env=~\"$env\"}[5m]))",
          "legendFormat": "{{entrypoint}}"
        }
      ],
      "options": {
        "tooltip": { "mode": "multi", "sort": "desc" },
        "legend": { "displayMode": "table", "placement": "bottom", "calcs": ["mean", "max", "lastNotNull"] }
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "reqps",
          "custom": {
            "drawStyle": "line",
            "lineInterpolation": "smooth",
            "lineWidth": 2,
            "fillOpacity": 10,
            "showPoints": "never"
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 12,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Requests by Status Class",
      "description": "Request rate split by HTTP status class: 2xx (success), 3xx (redirect), 4xx (client error), 5xx (server error). A rising 5xx band is the clearest sign of an outage.",
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
      "gridPos": { "h": 8, "w": 12, "x": 12, "y": 6 },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "sum by (code) (rate(traefik_entrypoint_requests_total{env=~\"$env\", code=~\"2..\"}[5m]))",
          "legendFormat": "2xx"
        },
        {
          "refId": "B",
          "expr": "sum by (code) (rate(traefik_entrypoint_requests_total{env=~\"$env\", code=~\"3..\"}[5m]))",
          "legendFormat": "3xx"
        },
        {
          "refId": "C",
          "expr": "sum by (code) (rate(traefik_entrypoint_requests_total{env=~\"$env\", code=~\"4..\"}[5m]))",
          "legendFormat": "4xx"
        },
        {
          "refId": "D",
          "expr": "sum by (code) (rate(traefik_entrypoint_requests_total{env=~\"$env\", code=~\"5..\"}[5m]))",
          "legendFormat": "5xx"
        }
      ],
      "options": {
        "tooltip": { "mode": "multi", "sort": "desc" },
        "legend": { "displayMode": "table", "placement": "bottom", "calcs": ["mean", "max", "lastNotNull"] }
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "reqps",
          "custom": {
            "drawStyle": "line",
            "lineInterpolation": "smooth",
            "lineWidth": 2,
            "fillOpacity": 20,
            "stacking": { "mode": "normal" },
            "showPoints": "never"
          }
        },
        "overrides": [
          {
            "matcher": { "id": "byName", "options": "5xx" },
            "properties": [
              { "id": "color", "value": { "mode": "fixed", "fixedColor": "red" } }
            ]
          },
          {
            "matcher": { "id": "byName", "options": "4xx" },
            "properties": [
              { "id": "color", "value": { "mode": "fixed", "fixedColor": "orange" } }
            ]
          },
          {
            "matcher": { "id": "byName", "options": "3xx" },
            "properties": [
              { "id": "color", "value": { "mode": "fixed", "fixedColor": "yellow" } }
            ]
          },
          {
            "matcher": { "id": "byName", "options": "2xx" },
            "properties": [
              { "id": "color", "value": { "mode": "fixed", "fixedColor": "green" } }
            ]
          }
        ]
      }
    },

    {
      "id": 20,
      "type": "row",
      "title": "Latency",
      "collapsed": false,
      "gridPos": { "h": 1, "w": 24, "x": 0, "y": 14 }
    },
    {
      "id": 21,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Latency Percentiles by Entrypoint",
      "description": "Request duration percentiles (p50, p95, p99) through Traefik. p99 tracks the worst-affected users; a rising p99 with stable p50 suggests a subset of requests is degrading.",
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
      "gridPos": { "h": 8, "w": 24, "x": 0, "y": 15 },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "histogram_quantile(0.50, sum by (le, entrypoint) (rate(traefik_entrypoint_request_duration_seconds_bucket{env=~\"$env\"}[5m])))",
          "legendFormat": "p50 {{entrypoint}}"
        },
        {
          "refId": "B",
          "expr": "histogram_quantile(0.95, sum by (le, entrypoint) (rate(traefik_entrypoint_request_duration_seconds_bucket{env=~\"$env\"}[5m])))",
          "legendFormat": "p95 {{entrypoint}}"
        },
        {
          "refId": "C",
          "expr": "histogram_quantile(0.99, sum by (le, entrypoint) (rate(traefik_entrypoint_request_duration_seconds_bucket{env=~\"$env\"}[5m])))",
          "legendFormat": "p99 {{entrypoint}}"
        }
      ],
      "options": {
        "tooltip": { "mode": "multi", "sort": "desc" },
        "legend": { "displayMode": "table", "placement": "bottom", "calcs": ["mean", "max", "lastNotNull"] }
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "s",
          "custom": {
            "drawStyle": "line",
            "lineInterpolation": "smooth",
            "lineWidth": 2,
            "fillOpacity": 0,
            "showPoints": "never"
          },
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              { "color": "green", "value": null },
              { "color": "yellow", "value": 0.5 },
              { "color": "red", "value": 2 }
            ]
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      }
    },

    {
      "id": 30,
      "type": "row",
      "title": "OTel Collector Pipeline",
      "collapsed": false,
      "gridPos": { "h": 1, "w": 24, "x": 0, "y": 23 }
    },
    {
      "id": 31,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Spans Received vs Exported",
      "description": "OTel Collector throughput. 'received' counts spans arriving from services. 'exported' counts spans successfully sent to Tempo. A gap that grows means spans are being dropped.",
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
      "gridPos": { "h": 8, "w": 12, "x": 0, "y": 24 },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "sum(rate(otelcol_receiver_accepted_spans{env=~\"$env\"}[5m]))",
          "legendFormat": "received"
        },
        {
          "refId": "B",
          "expr": "sum(rate(otelcol_exporter_sent_spans{env=~\"$env\"}[5m]))",
          "legendFormat": "exported"
        }
      ],
      "options": {
        "tooltip": { "mode": "multi", "sort": "desc" },
        "legend": { "displayMode": "table", "placement": "bottom", "calcs": ["mean", "max", "lastNotNull"] }
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short",
          "custom": {
            "drawStyle": "line",
            "lineInterpolation": "smooth",
            "lineWidth": 2,
            "fillOpacity": 10,
            "showPoints": "never"
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 32,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Export Failures",
      "description": "Spans the OTel Collector failed to export (to Tempo, or any other exporter). Should be zero in steady state. Any non-zero value means trace data loss.",
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
      "gridPos": { "h": 8, "w": 12, "x": 12, "y": 24 },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "sum(rate(otelcol_exporter_send_failed_spans{env=~\"$env\"}[5m]))",
          "legendFormat": "failures/s"
        }
      ],
      "options": {
        "tooltip": { "mode": "multi", "sort": "desc" },
        "legend": { "displayMode": "table", "placement": "bottom", "calcs": ["mean", "max", "lastNotNull"] }
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short",
          "custom": {
            "drawStyle": "line",
            "lineInterpolation": "smooth",
            "lineWidth": 2,
            "fillOpacity": 30,
            "showPoints": "never"
          },
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              { "color": "green", "value": null },
              { "color": "yellow", "value": 1 },
              { "color": "red", "value": 10 }
            ]
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      }
    },

    {
      "id": 40,
      "type": "row",
      "title": "Quick Links",
      "collapsed": false,
      "gridPos": { "h": 1, "w": 24, "x": 0, "y": 32 }
    },
    {
      "id": 41,
      "type": "text",
      "title": "",
      "description": "Direct links to the underlying observability tools. Use these when you need to query beyond what dashboards provide.",
      "datasource": null,
      "gridPos": { "h": 5, "w": 24, "x": 0, "y": 33 },
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "## Deeper Investigation\n\nUse these when a dashboard raises a question that needs an ad-hoc query.\n\n### Metrics\n- [**Prometheus** (direct UI)](http://prometheus.localhost) — PromQL queries, target status, rule evaluation\n- [**Grafana Explore → Prometheus**](/explore?left=%7B%22datasource%22:%22prometheus%22%7D) — ad-hoc queries within Grafana\n\n### Logs\n- [**Grafana Explore → Loki**](/explore?left=%7B%22datasource%22:%22loki%22%7D) — search and filter application logs\n\n### Traces\n- [**Grafana Explore → Tempo**](/explore?left=%7B%22datasource%22:%22tempo%22%7D) — search traces by service, operation, duration\n\n### Infrastructure\n- [**Traefik Dashboard**](http://traefik.localhost) — current routing table and backends\n- [**Kafka UI**](http://kafka-ui.localhost) — topics and consumer groups (Phase 5+)\n- [**pgAdmin**](http://pgadmin.localhost) — database browser\n- [**Keycloak Admin**](http://keycloak.localhost) — realm, users, clients\n\n---\n\n*Deeper dashboards (per-service, JVM, database) are added in Phase 1+. This overview stays as the top-level entry point.*"
      }
    }
  ],
  "links": [
    {
      "title": "Prometheus",
      "type": "link",
      "url": "http://prometheus.localhost",
      "icon": "external link",
      "targetBlank": true,
      "tooltip": "Open Prometheus UI"
    },
    {
      "title": "Traefik",
      "type": "link",
      "url": "http://traefik.localhost",
      "icon": "external link",
      "targetBlank": true,
      "tooltip": "Open Traefik dashboard"
    },
    {
      "title": "Keycloak",
      "type": "link",
      "url": "http://keycloak.localhost",
      "icon": "external link",
      "targetBlank": true,
      "tooltip": "Open Keycloak admin console"
    }
  ]
}